# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for `wrangler dev` local testing.
#
# Your free Gemini API key — https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-key-here
#
# Point the Worker at a locally-served copy of the knowledge base instead of the
# live site, so you can test kb/ changes before they are pushed/deployed. Run a
# static server from the REPO ROOT (`python3 -m http.server 8765`) after
# `make knowledge-base`, then use:
KB_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8765/family-tree-viewer/kb/
